<div class="field">
  <%= form.label :layout, "Layout" %>
  <p class="muted">
    The herdr tabs and panes each run's workspace opens with, as YAML. The agent is always the
    first pane of the first tab, and that is the tab a run opens on; every other tab and split is
    optional. Each pane's <span class="mono">command</span> is typed into its own shell in the run's
    worktree, with the same environment as the agent. Leave blank for the default shown here.
  </p>
  <%= form.text_area :layout, rows: 14, class: "mono", placeholder: Orchestrator::WorkspaceLayout::DEFAULT_YAML %>
</div>
